  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(0.54)³ + (0.46)³\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a + b)³ = a³ + b³ + 3ab(a + b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nLet a = 0.54 and b = 0.46\n\na + b = 0.54 + 0.46 = 1\n\n(0.54)³ + (0.46)³ = (a + b)³ - 3ab(a + b)\n\n⇒ (0.54)³ + (0.46)³ = 1³ - 3 × (0.54 × 0.46) × 1\n\n⇒ (0.54)³ + (0.46)³ = 1 - 3 × 0.2484\n\n⇒ (0.54)³ + (0.46)³ = 1 - 0.7452\n\n⇒ (0.54)³ + (0.46)³ = 0.2548\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (3).**",
